                                                "sense_id": "0214ea58-7480-30fe-bebd-db92988d64bf",
                                                "text": "He draws from modernism and its malcontents: Morton Feldman, Olivier Messaien, Thelonious Monk. He pulls heavily from Cuban folk traditions: Changüi, Abakuá, danzón."
                                            },
