                                                "sense_id": "0214ea58-7480-30fe-bebd-db92988d64bf",
                                                "text": "She leads the Ballet Theater orchestra throughout the run and lends vivid delicacy to the cinematic music, which incorporates traditional instruments and forms like danzón."
                                            }
